  "title": "Apple's iPhone Duo Launch and India's Market Response",
  "summary": "Apple's iPhone Duo is set to launch in India, featuring a foldable form factor and new camera features, marking a debut in the foldable phone market. The iPhone lineup includes enhanced AI and security enhancements, while Apple's revamped Siri is the backbone of the user experience. The new phone has a 5.4-inch outer display, a 7.6-inch inner display, a 'nano-texture' finish, and Touch ID on the power button. Additionally, early demand is showing up for the iPhone Duo as analysts assess whether the foldable can lift iPhone pricing and revenue.",
